<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Neuhaus IPO priced at 1,750 Bfr a share.</title>
<headline>Belgian Neuhaus IPO priced at 1,750 Bfr a share.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in an initial public offering (IPO) by Belgian chocolates maker  Neuhaus have been priced at 1,750 Belgian francs each, lead manager Petercam said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
